NG XCEL ENERGY THE USE OF ANTERIX'S 900 MHZ SPECTRUM THROUGHOUT THE COMPANY'S SERVICE TERRITORY IN EIGHT WESTERN AND MIDWESTERN STATES. THE AGREEMENT PROVIDES XCEL ENERGY DEDICATED USE OF THE 900 MHZ SPECTRUM FOR 20 YEARS, WITH TWO OPTIONAL TEN-YEAR EXTENSIONS."}